# Internal working documents — they live on the owner's machine and are not
# part of the published product. Untracked forward-only on 31 Jul 2026; they
# remain visible in earlier commits, which is accepted.
#
# ARABIC_MASTERY.md is deliberately NOT here. It is a build input, not a
# document: build-rules.mjs and build-mastery-prompt.mjs read it,
# check-artifacts.mjs hashes it, and artifacts.manifest.mjs names it as the
# source of both generated artifacts. Untrack it and npm test dies at step 2.
# It also ships publicly under GPL by the owner's decision.
CLAUDE.md
DISTRIBUTION.md
PHASE1_SPEC.md
